        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The mere presence of the Reaper causes all living creatures in their vicinity to shiver in fear. Any living creature within 30 feet of the Reaper has to make a @Check[type:will|dc:25] save the first time they are exposed to Aura of Despair.</p><p>No matter the result of the check, affected creatures are immune to Aura of Despair for 1 minute.</p><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed} for 1 turn.</p>"
        },
